{
    "background_story": "Kaiya was a talented young artist, known for her vibrant paintings that captured the beauty of the world around her. However, a tragic accident left her with a severe hand injury, impairing her ability to hold a brush. Devastated, Kaiya struggled to come to terms with the loss of her creative outlet. But she refused to give up. With the help of her loved ones, she learned to adapt, experimenting with new techniques and tools that allowed her to continue creating art despite her physical limitations. Kaiya's determination and resilience inspired those around her, and her art took on a new depth and meaning. Though her injury had impaired her physical abilities, it had not diminished her spirit or creativity.",
